Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 20:41:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] feat(moe): prefix-cache PP model wiring, optional
 shared-expert overlap

Port the model-side pieces of the accepted PP stack onto main b02e16a895.

- qwen4_exp.py: call expert_stream.prefetch_first_layer at the top of the
  layer loop so the PP7 staging / PP11 batched-DMA / PP14 cross-layer
  prefetch helpers in expert_stream.py are driven from the model. Full-table
  gather and first-layer prefetch stay behind their default-off env switches.
- qwen2_moe.py: honour SGLANG_MOE_EAGER_SHARED_OVERLAP_MAX_TOKENS for the
  shared-expert alternate stream (default 0 = disabled, as in the promoted
  launcher).
---
 python/sglang/srt/models/qwen2_moe.py | 17 ++++++++++++++++-
 python/sglang/srt/models/qwen4_exp.py |  3 +++
 2 files changed, 19 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

